Note: This is a placeholder. You'll need to:
1. Open logo.svg in a browser
2. Take a screenshot or use an online converter
3. Save as logo.png (512x512px)
4. Upload to your server

Or use this command if you have ImageMagick installed:
convert logo.svg -resize 512x512 logo.png

For the Open Graph image:
1. Open og-image-template.html in a browser
2. Take a screenshot at 1200x630px
3. Save as og-image.png
4. Upload to your server